ta — 2026-W20b#4. Staging — `pub/planned` queue starts moving":[105,118],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#4. Staging — `pub/planned` queue starts moving#`staging/But What is a Machine.md` — drafted (May 12–14)":[107,110],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#4. Staging — `pub/planned` queue starts moving#`staging/But What is a Machine.md` — drafted (May 12–14)#{1}":[109,110],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#4. Staging — `pub/planned` queue starts moving#`staging/Work.md` — NEW, empty (May 14)":[111,118],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#4. Staging — `pub/planned` queue starts moving#`staging/Work.md` — NEW, empty (May 14)#{1}":[113,118],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#5. Minor additions":[119,125],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#5. Minor additions#{1}":[121,121],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#5. Minor additions#{2}":[122,123],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#5. Minor additions#{3}":[124,125],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING":[126,159],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The HRMS gambit has resolved into concession, not deployment.":[128,131],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The HRMS gambit has resolved into concession, not deployment.#{1}":[130,131],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The Anthropic application path now has *internal* materializations, not just stated intentions.":[132,135],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The Anthropic application path now has *internal* materializations, not just stated intentions.#{1}":[134,135],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The 9-row matrix is the author re-debugging his own surface area.":[136,141],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#The 9-row matrix is the author re-debugging his own surface area.#{1}":[138,141],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#`projs/alice/` is the first project folder to be born from a weekly-note matrix.":[142,145],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W20b#STRUCTURAL READING#`projs/alice/` is the first project folder to be born from a weekly-note matrix.#{1}":[144,145],"#Vault Delta — 2026-W2